Catalog Error: Pragma Function with name boilstream_bootstrap_session does not exist!

# Require statement will ensure this test is run with this extension loaded
require boilstream

# Confirm the extension loads without error
# Note: The actual token exchange will fail (no server running), but the extension should load
# and validate the URL format correctly

# Test with valid HTTPS URL format (will fail on token exchange - expected)
statement error
PRAGMA boilstream_bootstrap_session('https://localhost:443/secrets:ffe14a7a000000010000000168e4f9a5bcca736c3adaaf0f63e735f881adc397db6da85f1b9e231f70bbf6f71db4ef9fad837bc8');
